{"id":"vod_sn_58379","vodId":"58379","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"金色时光","name_cn":"金色时光","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"HD","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20231219-1/26277eb3ed9408db7e77fc2ede576725.jpg"},"summary":"19岁的多田万里（古川慎 配音）只身赴东京读大学，入学当日遇到同样是法学系新生的柳泽光央（石川界人 配音），二人随即成为朋友。此时，一个光芒万丈、引人瞩目的漂亮大小姐出现在二人回校路上，她手持一束玫瑰，突然殴打柳泽。原来她叫加贺香子（崛江由衣 配音），是柳泽的青梅竹马， 她为人强势，有自己一套完美的“人生剧本“，而剧本的男主角，就是她狂热喜欢着的柳泽。柳泽视她为洪水猛兽，唯恐避之不及，然而还是逃不过她的追随。面对这么一位耀眼的大小姐，看起来平平凡凡的万里，又会与之碰撞出怎么样的青春故事？\r\n　　新大学，新朋友，新住所，对于万里来说，大学生活显得如此新鲜，值得期待。未来的一切，闪着金色的光芒。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-12-19 15:04:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":20,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202312/18/emP5yJYFYY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202312/18/pzhsNbK7an1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202312/18/zw3PhUmfeh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202312/18/Jc80UP5dvX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202312/18/tQMHbjfTfp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202312/18/rk5AGxRjye1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202312/18/K8ygf2sZaT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202312/18/4SQk0z30U21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202312/18/ft587qdJtS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202312/18/87QbJVrZFT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202312/18/C4wGHc94wR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202312/18/K9MTma6Ybk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202312/18/UVN3jyNrgt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202312/18/K8ZTQJXjWP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"